The `edcb` package in this directory is vendored from KonomiTV
(https://github.com/tsukumijima/KonomiTV), files under server/app/utils/edcb/,
which is itself a port of xtne6f/edcb.py (https://github.com/xtne6f/edcb.py).

KonomiTV is licensed under the MIT License.

Local modifications for jf-dvr:
- Removed dependencies on KonomiTV internals (app.config.Config and
  app.constants.JST).
- Added a module-level EDCB connection URL holder (set_edcb_url / get_edcb_url)
  in __init__.py, and a local JST definition in CtrlCmdUtil.py.
- Rewrote intra-package imports (app.utils.edcb.* -> relative imports).

